     "Hi Justine,<div><br></div><div>I haven&#39;t tried to run Garnett on Visium data. On an engineering level you should be able to use the package so long as you can generate a cell_data_set object (i.e. the code should work), however unless your tissue is very pure and you expect spots to each only have one cell type, I would guess that the classification will not work very well because of the mixing. Hope this helps!</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Hannah<br><br></div>"
